              "claim": "An explicit REQUIREMENTS_PYTHON selection is silently discarded when it is unavailable or supplied as an interpreter name resolved through PATH. The launcher substitutes python3, so probe can report success under a different interpreter and analyze can use a different solver installation. Preserve fallback only for the implicit default; resolve or reject an explicit selection instead.",
