              "location": "bin/gentle-ai:11",
              "severity": "CRITICAL",
              "claim": "An explicitly selected REQUIREMENTS_PYTHON interpreter is silently discarded when it is missing or not executable. For example, after a configured virtual environment is removed during an upgrade, probe still succeeds using python3, and analyze can succeed using a different installed solver environment. This hides the broken runtime configuration and violates the documented interpreter selection. Fall back only when no explicit override was supplied; otherwise report the unavailable interpreter and exit nonzero.",
